OL,3,AKing Charles appears on Sir Elton
OL,4,AJohn's radio show
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III has appeared on Sir
OL,7,FElton John's radio show in an episode
OL,8,Fset to coincide with the monarch's 78th
OL,9,Fbirthday.
OL,11,FDuring the Rocket Hour show, the King
OL,12,Fsaid the pop star had become "a
OL,13,Fnational treasure after all these
OL,14,Fyears", to which the singer joked:
OL,15,F"I'll be on the Antiques Roadshow."
OL,17,F"Join the club," the King replied.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
